# Generated from container/runner.mjs by scripts/embed-runner.mjs, which runs
# as wrangler's build step and as `pretypecheck`. Committing it put a second,
# independently-editable copy of the runner in the tree — and it went stale,
# which is the drift ADR 0007 exists to prevent. Not tracked, so there is
# nothing to go stale.
src/infrastructure/runner-source.ts
